  "description": "Worked examples of the recorded colour form. authored = RGBA floats before any modifier, held as binary32 (the precision Citrus authors in; a consumer converts the decimal to float32 first); brightness folded in before quantisation; quantization rgba8_round_half_up_v1 unless stated; derivation plain_v1 unless stated (appearance.element_derivations).",
